WEBVTT

00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:04.700
Becoming senior isn't about knowing more.

00:00:05.800 --> 00:00:11.900
It's judgment — framing the real problem, mapping a system you can
defend, deciding under pressure and proving you're right.

00:00:12.900 --> 00:00:19.300
One loop, every lesson: frame, map, decide, prove.

00:00:20.500 --> 00:00:28.700
Built on how people actually learn — active recall, spaced repetition,
and productive failure.

00:00:29.900 --> 00:00:33.000
That's the method. Watch it work — try a lesson, free.
